# Line-ending policy. The repo is authored on Linux (LF). Without this, Windows
# and Orca checkouts render every file as modified (CRLF vs LF), which looked
# like uncommitted work and triggered a whole investigation on 2026-08-29
# (evt_130f6e9c). Normalize everything to LF in the repo and on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated/embedded files: still LF, rewritten by `npm run build`.
packages/core/src/ui-html.ts text eol=lf

# Binaries git must never line-normalize.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.db   binary
